\\u003cstrong\\u003eBonita\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Pretty, beautiful (feminine). \\u003cstrong\\u003eBonito\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Pretty, handsome (masculine). \\u003cstrong\\u003eChico\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Boy, little one. \\u003cstrong\\u003eChica\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Girl. \\u003cstrong\\u003eCielo\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Heaven, sky. \\u003cstrong\\u003eCorazón\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Heart. For pets who are your heart. \\u003cstrong\\u003eDulce\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Sweet. \\u003cstrong\\u003eEstrella\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Star. \\u003cstrong\\u003eLinda\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Cute, pretty. \\u003cstrong\\u003eLindo\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Cute, handsome. \\u003cstrong\\u003eLuna\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Moon. One of the most popular pet names worldwide. \\u003cstrong\\u003ePerla\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Pearl. \\u003cstrong\\u003eReina\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Queen. \\u003cstrong\\u003eRey\\u003c/strong\\u003e — King. \\u003cstrong\\u003eSol\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Sun. \\u003cstrong\\u003eVida\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Life.\\\"}}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Nature-Inspired Spanish Names\\\"]}]\\n2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Spanish nature words make beautiful, evocative pet names that connect your companion to the natural world:\\\"]}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eAlma\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Soul. \\u003cstrong\\u003eAurora\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Dawn. \\u003cstrong\\u003eBrisa\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Breeze. \\u003cstrong\\u003eCanela\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Cinnamon. \\u003cstrong\\u003eCielo\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Sky. \\u003cstrong\\u003eFlor\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Flower. \\u003cstrong\\u003eIsla\\u003c/strong\\u003e — Island. \\u003