$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These classic Spanish names have stood the test of time and remain beloved choices for pets around the world:\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Amigo</strong> — Friend. Perfect for a loyal companion. <strong>Bonita</strong> — Pretty, beautiful (feminine). <strong>Bonito</strong> — Pretty, handsome (masculine). <strong>Chico</strong> — Boy, little one. <strong>Chica</strong> — Girl. <strong>Cielo</strong> — Heaven, sky. <strong>Corazón</strong> — Heart. For pets who are your heart. <strong>Dulce</strong> — Sweet. <strong>Estrella</strong> — Star. <strong>Linda</strong> — Cute, pretty. <strong>Lindo</strong> — Cute, handsome. <strong>Luna</strong> — Moon. One of the most popular pet names worldwide. <strong>Perla</strong> — Pearl. <strong>Reina</strong> — Queen. <strong>Rey</strong> — King. <strong>Sol</strong> — Sun. <strong>Vida</strong> — Life.\"}}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Nature-Inspired Spanish Names\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Spanish nature words make beautiful, evocative pet names that connect your companion to the natural world:\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Alma</strong> — Soul. <strong>Aurora</strong> — Dawn. <strong>Brisa</strong> — Breeze. <strong>Canela</strong> — Cinnamon. <strong>Cielo</strong> — Sky. <strong>Flor</strong> — Flower. <strong>Isla</strong> — Island. <strong>Lluvia</strong> — Rain. <strong>Luz</strong> — Light. <strong>Mar</strong> — Sea. <strong>Montaña</strong> — Mountain. <strong>Nieve</strong> — Snow. <strong>Paloma</strong> — Dove. <strong>Río</strong> — River. <strong>Rosa</strong> — Rose. <strong>Selva</